	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01_badman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サンヨウの　ジムリーダーたち
オレ　まだ　かってないのに……▼
だけど　いいんだ▼
むこうから　いどみたくなる　ぐらい
つよい　トレーナーに　なるからさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T09:37:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サンヨウの　ジムリーダーたち
オレ　まだ　勝ってないのに……▼
だけど　いいんだ▼
向こうから　挑戦したくなるほど
強い　トレーナーに　なるからさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T09:28:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T09:24:05" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BADMAN
不良</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T08:43:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01_boy2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　タイプと
わざの　タイプが　おなじだと▽
いりょくが　アップ！▼
ジュエルを　もたせておくと
わざの　いりょくが　さらに　アップ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T09:41:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　タイプと
技の　タイプが　同じだと▽
威力が　アップ！▼
ジュエルを　持たせておくと
技の　威力が　さらに　アップ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-22T03:32:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T09:41:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY2
少年（活発）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T08:43:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01_cleaningm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ゆめのあとち　には
こうじょうが　さかえていたころの▽
ゆめが　いっぱい　のこっておる▼
その　ゆめに　みちびかれる
ポケモンが　いるやも　しれんな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T07:45:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>夢の跡地には
工場が　栄えていたころの▽
夢が　いっぱい　残っておる▼
その夢に　導かれる
ポケモンが　いるやも　しれんな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-09T07:45:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-25T09:49:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>OLDMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-10T08:43:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01_breederw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>スクールで　まなんだことを　だれかに
おしえて　ひろがる　ポケモンの　わ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T06:40:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>スクールで　学んだことを　だれかに
教えて　広がる　ポケモンの　輪！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-17T06:40:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
