			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:20:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>金色の　『特別』メダルが
ひときわ　輝いているわ！▼
人生は　スペシャル！▼
同じ日は　繰り返さない……
毎日が　特別な　宝物！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-02T03:04:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:28:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・とくべつの比率が高い
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:29:25" />
		</CommentCell>
